		"description": "<p><em>Grenade Kit — Toolbelt option.</em></p><p><strong>Concussion Grenade — 2 Actions, 1 Toolbelt scrap.</strong> Range 6, Blast 2. On a failed STR save, targets are Blinded, Dazed, and Slowed, 1 turn. On a save, they are only Dazed.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 1 Toolbelt scrap — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] STR save: Blinded, Dazed and Slowed on a fail; Dazed on a save.</em></p><p><em>[M] The conditions last 1 turn.</em></p>",
